  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Enforcado fala de entrega, pausa e nova perspectiva.",
      "Ele representa a virada de valores que vem do despertar interior.",
      "O foco dele é: aceitar a suspensão e ver o mundo de outro ângulo."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Hanged Man speaks of surrender, pause and a new perspective.",
      "He stands for the reversal of values that comes with inner awakening.",
      "His focus: accepting the suspension and seeing the world from another angle."
    ]
  },
